
//Here is the classification of the 23 del Pezzo surfaces gotten by considering arrangements of magic squares of 5 squares up to isomorphism over Qbar mentioned in Section 4. Each configuration defines a complete intersection of 2 diagonal quadrics in P^4. Since the quadrics are simultaneously diagonal, isomorphism reduces to the PGL_2-orbit on P^1 of the 5 degenerate-pencil parameters [c2_i : -c1_i], with multiplicity (the Segre symbol). This was written with the help of Claude.
 
